  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p>Brand Introduction: LIVELUSSO</p>\r\n<p>Product Description: Live Lusso offers premium, made-to-order sofas that bring luxury and sophistication to any home. Each piece is handcrafted with attention to detail, ensuring comfort, durability, and a design uniquely suited to your space.</p>\r\n<p>Unique Selling Points:</p>\r\n<p><br>- Free White Glove Delivery: Our delivery service includes careful placement, unpacking, and installation of your sofa at no extra cost.<br>- Free Stain Protection Upgrade: All sofas come with free stain protection, providing lasting protection and peace of mind.<br>- Free Assembly: We handle the assembly, so you don&rsquo;t have to.<br>- Loan Sofas: Enjoy a loan sofa while waiting for your custom order, ensuring comfort without delay.<br>- Competitive Pricing: Luxury meets affordability with our fair and transparent pricing, offering true value.</p>\r\n<p>Payment Terms: 30-day payment terms after sale to provide a convenient and flexible purchasing experience.</p>\r\n<p>Collaborations and Partnerships: We&rsquo;re looking to collaborate with content creators, influencers, and affiliates who share our love for quality and design. Reach out to explore exciting partnership opportunities!</p>\r\n<p>Production and Delivery: Made to order and delivered within 12 weeks, every sofa is crafted exclusively for you, creating a one-of-a-kind addition to your home.</p>",
